abstract: >-
  A 16-week, 64-hour bilingual (English/Chinese) university course hub
  for AI application development: syllabus, original lecture decks and
  lesson plans, student lab notebooks, and curated redistribution of
  MIT 6.S191 slides with a one-click Stanford CS224n downloader.
